{"about_the_game":"<strong>Everslash</strong> is an action platformer game where you have to move quickly and attack with your scythe. Use your Slash Attack move to dodge and strike your foes at the same time; defeat the monsters infesting the lab and find your way out.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>Youth reporter 'Mari Yun' goes to 'SongHwa Life Sciences', the lab where her older sister Sewon Yun works, for her first assignment. However, Sewon disappears to cause an accident, which worries Mari who sets out to find her sister in the underground research facility. When Mari reaches the research facility, she finds it\u2019s packed with strange monsters.<br><br>The player must navigate through the vast stage to unravel the conspiracy behind the labs and monsters. Who are the people chasing Sewon? What are the monsters, and where did they come from? What happened to Sewon after she disappeared?","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"75fbcf3596d7ca670b01897c97f60eea4efb6f61.jpg","localized_name":"Thank You for Playing!","name":"Thank You for Playing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1152820/75fbcf3596d7ca670b01897c97f60eea4efb6f61.jpg"},{"icon":"a250940a5a8ffd9d17dc1f46f58c11012db09af2.jpg","localized_name":"What's Sewon doing with these things!!","name":"What's Sewon doing with these things!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1152820/a250940a5a8ffd9d17dc1f46f58c11012db09af2.jpg"},{"icon":"17af190d240d705dea5ea1266b0bd40aaac498cf.jpg","localized_name":"Hallucination Fighter","name":"Hallucination Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1152820/17af190d240d705dea5ea1266b0bd40aaac498cf.jpg"},{"icon":"d56a7cfbc8a2188ac60ba5dac3d681f91f2bc046.jpg","localized_name":"Plan Destroyer","name":"Plan Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1152820/d56a7cfbc8a2188ac60ba5dac3d681f91f2bc046.jpg"},